      "text": "Everything on this canvas is ours, not KiddoFizz's:\n\n• Wordmark, label and bottle are placeholder artwork\n• Copy is drafted to fit the layout — swap it for the client's own wording\n• Photography and nutrition figures are left as empty slots on purpose"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-sequence",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 960,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "These four frames are ONE scroll section, not four pages.\n\nThe bottle pins in the middle of the screen and turns a quarter rotation per beat while the background colour changes underneath it.\n\nThe live prototype shows this actually working."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-colour",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 1880,
      "w": 320,
      "text": "Colour rule:\n\nNear-white base on every section, one accent colour dominant per section. The page reads colourful because you scroll through the palette — not because any one screen is crowded.\n\nBrand red is kept for the wordmark, the main button and the flavour beat. Nowhere else."
    }
